        <h1>Privacy Policy for Aesthetic Widgets, Theme: iWidgets</h1>
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> September 29, 2026</p>
        <p><strong>App Name:</strong> Aesthetic Widgets, Theme: iWidgets</p>
        <p><strong>Developer/Entity:</strong> Phoenix</p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Introduction</h2>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>Aesthetic Widgets, Theme: iWidgets</strong> ("we," "our," or "us"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data when you use our mobile application (the "App"), which provides customizable widgets, themes, and home screen personalization tools inspired by iWidget designs.</p>
        <p>By downloading, installing, or using the App, you agree to the terms outlined in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with our practices, please discontinue use of the App.</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We believe in data minimization and only collect information necessary to provide and improve your widget and theme customization experience:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Non-Personal & Device Data:</strong> We may collect technical data such as your device type, operating system version, app version, and basic usage analytics (e.g., features clicked, themes applied) to help us troubleshoot bugs and optimize performance.</li>
            <li><strong>User Preferences & Settings:</strong> Data regarding your chosen widget layouts, color palettes, custom images, and theme configurations are stored locally on your device.</li>
            <li><strong>Optional Permissions (Photos/Storage):</strong> If you choose to use your own photos or images to create custom photo widgets, the App will request access to your device’s local photo library. We only access the specific images you select and do not store or upload your photo library to external servers.</li>
            <li><strong>Location Data (If Applicable):</strong> For weather or clock widgets requiring location updates, the App may request permission to access your device's approximate location. This data is used solely to fetch real-time weather information and is not retained or shared.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>To deliver, maintain, and personalize the App's widget and theme features.</li>
            <li>To save your custom home screen configurations and preferences locally.</li>
            <li>To analyze app performance, crash reports, and user trends to improve functionality.</li>
            <li>To provide responsive customer support and respond to your inquiries.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data Storage and Security</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> The majority of your customized themes, downloaded layouts, and personalized widget assets are stored directly on your device.</li>
            <li><strong>Security Measures:</strong> We implement commercially reasonable technical and administrative safeguards to protect any data processed by the App against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. However, no digital transmission or storage system is 100% secure.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>The App may integrate with trusted third-party services (such as analytics providers or ad networks, if applicable) to help us understand app usage or support free features. These third parties may collect anonymized technical data in accordance with their own respective privacy policies.</p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Aesthetic Widgets, Theme: iWidgets does not knowingly collect, solicit, or maintain personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe that a child has provided us with personal information without parental consent, please contact us, and we will promptly delete such data.</p>

        <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, technology, or legal requirements. We will post any updates directly within this section of the App, and the "Effective Date" at the top will be revised accordingly. Your continued use of the App after changes signifies your acceptance of the revised policy.</p>

